@startuml 纹理采样器工作原理
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #FFF3E0
skinparam componentBorderColor #EF6C00
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #E8F5E9
skinparam noteBorderColor #2E7D32
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei

title 纹理采样器工作原理

package "纹理采样流程" {
    component "像素着色器" as PS {
        [UV坐标输入\n(u, v)] as UV
    }
    
    component "采样器状态" as Sampler {
        [过滤模式\nFilter] as Filter
        [寻址模式\nAddressMode] as Address
        [Mipmap控制\nLOD] as LOD
    }
    
    component "纹理资源" as Texture {
        [Mip Level 0\n(原始尺寸)] as Mip0
        [Mip Level 1\n(1/2尺寸)] as Mip1
        [Mip Level 2\n(1/4尺寸)] as Mip2
        [Mip Level n\n(1x1)] as MipN
    }
    
    component "最终颜色" as Color {
        [RGBA] as RGBA
    }
}

UV --> Sampler : UV坐标 (0~1)

note top of Sampler
    <b>D3D11_SAMPLER_DESC配置</b>
    Filter = MIN_MAG_MIP_LINEAR
    AddressU = WRAP
    AddressV = WRAP
    AddressW = WRAP
    MinLOD = 0
    MaxLOD = D3D11_FLOAT32_MAX
end note

Sampler --> Filter : 选择过滤算法

note right of Filter
    <b>MIN_MAG_MIP_LINEAR</b>
    Min: 缩小时线性插值
    Mag: 放大时线性插值
    Mip: Mipmap层级间线性插值
    
    <b>其他选项:</b>
    POINT: 最近邻采样（锯齿）
    ANISOTROPIC: 各向异性（高质量）
end note

Sampler --> Address : 处理边界UV

note right of Address
    <b>WRAP模式（平铺）</b>
    u = u - floor(u)
    允许UV超出[0,1]范围
    
    <b>其他模式:</b>
    CLAMP: 截断到[0,1]
    MIRROR: 镜像重复
    BORDER: 边界颜色
end note

Sampler --> LOD : 计算Mipmap层级

note right of LOD
    <b>LOD (Level of Detail)</b>
    根据像素覆盖的纹素数量
    自动选择合适的Mip层级
    
    远处物体 → 高LOD（小纹理）
    近处物体 → 低LOD（大纹理）
end note

LOD --> Texture : 选择Mip层级

note bottom of Texture
    <b>Mipmap层级</b>
    每级是上一级的1/2尺寸
    减少远处纹理的走样
    提高性能和质量
end note

Texture --> Color : 采样纹素并插值

note bottom of Color
    <b>双线性插值</b>
    采样周围4个纹素
    根据UV小数部分插值
    
    <b>三线性插值</b>
    在相邻两个Mip层级间
    再进行插值
end note

@enduml
